From f8372fd89f05a35c681f46b8dcfb08e14ad0857f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eugene <tweels@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:07:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] vm_x86: implemented new x87 JIT compiler vm_x86: use more
 explicit x87 precision/rounding control for better determination vm_x86:
 corrected NaN-checks for CPUs without fast FPU comparisons vm_x86: optimized
 some int->float SSE conversions FS: refined filesystem checks (e.g. check
 extensions of a short source file not whole ospath)

